               <title>PRINCIPAL DISPLAY PANEL</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>NDC 49035-772-03</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>equate</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Compare to Children's Mucinex®Multi-Symptom Cold &amp; Fever active ingredients*</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Children's Multi-Symptom Cold &amp; Fever Liquid</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>
                     <content styleCode="bold">Acetaminophen</content> 325 mg<br/> Pain reliever/Fever Reducer</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Dextromethorphan HBr 10 mg</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Cough Suppressant <br/>Guaifenesin 200 mg<br/>
                  </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Expectorant<br/>Phenylephrine HCl 5 mg </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Nasal Decongestant<br/>
                     <br/> AGES 6 to 12 YEARS</paragraph>
